# --- Things to gather, as suits the island (the user, 2026-10-05): pines, berries, birches ----------
scatter "Pickup_Landmark_Tree_Pine" 6 at 0 0 r=70.0 seed=4421 free=5
scatter "Pickup_Landmark_BerryBush" 6 at 0 0 r=70.0 seed=4431 free=3
scatter "Pickup_Landmark_Tree_Birch" 6 at 0 0 r=70.0 seed=4441 free=5

# ===== Settings, story items, notes, behaviours, quest (22 steps, 3 chapters) =============================================
info title=The Island of Stations
info author=Custom Islands
info description=A misty forest marsh where a plane came down - and found the island already full of buildings: the stations of a research initiative that vanished, each keeping one card of a Sequence. Gather the five cards, find the hatch in the marsh and enter the Sequence before the counter runs out.
island on.arrive=message||A long, low, misty island. On the south beach, the tail of a plane sticks up out of the reeds. Further in, an aerial - and a dish.

story seqcard|Sequence card|quest:Vasagatan_KeyCard|A stamped card with one number of the Initiative's Sequence on it.
story accesscard|Vault access card|quest:Tangaroa_KeyCard|The vault's access card, printed by the hatch's terminal when the Sequence was entered.

note survivorsjournal Survivors' journal | ISLAND AIR FLIGHT 9 - SURVIVORS' JOURNAL\n\nDay 1. We came down in the marsh. Forty-one of us walked away.\nDay 6. There are buildings on this island. Somebody built them and left - or didn't leave.\nDay 14. A hatch in the marsh, its lid open, a ladder going down. The terminal down there wants five numbers.\nDay 30. The people in the village in the west came at night and took our compass and our maps. They won't speak to us.\nDay 41. A boat. Most of us are going. Kim stays - she wants to know what's in the hatch. Her notes are at the station with the aerials on the east rise.
note orientation Orientation notes | THE HALDEN INITIATIVE - ORIENTATION (Kim's copy, typed from the projector reel)\n\nWelcome to the Island. Six stations, one purpose:\nGull - communications (you are here).\nKelp - the marine lab, in the bay.\nPike - zoology. Mind the cages.\nMoth - the residents' village.\nLantern - the observatory on the north hill.\nThe Hatch.\n\nEach station keeps one card of the Sequence. The Sequence is entered at the Hatch's terminal; it opens the Initiative's vault for sixty seconds.\n\n(Kim, in pencil:) Gull's card is in the desk. Kelp sank in a storm. Pike's bear is OUT. The village took Moth's card. Lantern's is in the observatory.
note gullsign Station Gull | THE HALDEN INITIATIVE - STATION GULL - COMMUNICATIONS\n\n(under it, scratched) nobody answers
note pikesign Station Pike | THE HALDEN INITIATIVE - STATION PIKE - ZOOLOGY\nDo not feed the specimens. Do not open the cages.
note mothsign Station Moth | THE HALDEN INITIATIVE - STATION MOTH - RESIDENCE\nResidents only. Curfew at dark.
note manual Hatch manual | THE HATCH - OPERATING MANUAL\n\n1. Enter the Sequence at the terminal: all five cards.\n2. The vault door opens for sixty seconds, no more.\n3. When the counter reaches zero the door closes. If you are inside, pull the emergency release.\n4. Do not let anyone tell you nothing happens when the counter reaches zero.
note gullcard Gull's card drawer | The comms desk's drawer: headphones, a pencil - and a stamped card with one number of the Sequence.
loot gullcard story:seqcard*1;CircuitBoard*1
prop gullcard loot.refill=0
note kelpcard Kelp's lab cupboard | A lab cupboard in the sunken station, its door swollen shut, then open: specimen jars - and the station's Sequence card in a sealed sleeve.
loot kelpcard story:seqcard*1;Glass*3
prop kelpcard loot.refill=0
note pikecard Pike keeper's locker | The zoo keeper's locker: a stun prod with a dead battery, a bear's feeding schedule - and Pike's Sequence card.
loot pikecard story:seqcard*1;Battery*1
prop pikecard loot.refill=0
note mothcard Council hall cupboard | The village council's cupboard: the survivors' compass and maps - taken, but kept neatly - and Station Moth's Sequence card.
loot mothcard story:seqcard*1;Compass*1
prop mothcard loot.refill=0
note lanterncard Lantern's file box | The observatory's file box: star charts, a log of lights seen over the sea - and the last Sequence card.
loot lanterncard story:seqcard*1;Glass*2
prop lanterncard loot.refill=0
note vault Initiative's vault | The Initiative's vault: crates of its equipment's plans, batteries, circuits, rations for a decade - and a film reel labelled ORIENTATION 2 - DO NOT WATCH.
loot vault Blueprint_BatteryCharger*1;Blueprint_ZiplineTool*1;Battery*3;CircuitBoard*4;TitaniumIngot*3
prop vault loot.refill=0
note trunk Passenger's trunk | A passenger's trunk thrown clear of the plane: clothes, a camera, a jar of sweets.
loot trunk Wool*2;Plastic*3;Glass*2
prop trunk loot.refill=0
note campbox Survivors' camp box | The camp's box: the last of the plane's water and peanuts, a flare gun with no flares.
loot campbox PlasticBottle_Water*3;Coconut*2;Rope*2
prop campbox loot.refill=0
note gulllocker Gull's locker | The comms officer's locker: spare valves, wire, a sweater.
loot gulllocker CopperIngot*2;Wool*2;Bolt*2
prop gulllocker loot.refill=0
note baybarrel Barrel in the bay | A barrel from the plane's hold, washed into the bay: tins and tools.
loot baybarrel Scrap*3;MetalOre*2;Cooked_GenericMeat*2
prop baybarrel loot.refill=0
note feedstore Pike's feed store | The zoo's feed store: sacks of fish meal, a scoop, rope for the cages.
loot feedstore Raw_Mackerel*3;Rope*3;Nail*6
prop feedstore loot.refill=0
note villagefridge Village fridge | A fridge in a village house, humming on a generator nobody seems to tend: milk, eggs, a cake with one slice gone.
loot villagefridge Egg*3;Bucket_Milk*1;Cooked_GenericMeat*1
prop villagefridge loot.refill=0
note lanternbox Observatory crate | A crate in the observatory: lens cloths, lamp oil, a spare eyepiece.
loot lanternbox Glass*2;BioFuel*1;Plank*4
prop lanternbox loot.refill=0
note rations Hatch rations | Shelves of the Initiative's rations, every tin stamped with a gull, a fish, a moth.
loot rations Cooked_GenericMeat*3;Claybowl_SimpleFishStew*2;PlasticBottle_Water*2
prop rations loot.refill=0

prop terminal obj.name=terminal
prop terminal beh.use=Enter the Sequence
prop terminal if.use=has|story:seqcard|5
prop terminal on.use=message||You type the five numbers. The terminal beeps, prints a card - and the vault door slides open. The counter on the wall starts: 60... 59... 58...\ngive||story:accesscard*1\nopen|vaultdoor\nsound||event:/exploring/obstacles/keypad/keypad_selene_correct\nwait|60\nclose|vaultdoor\nmessage||The counter reaches zero. The vault door slams shut - and for a moment every light in the hatch flickers. Enter the Sequence again to reopen it.
prop terminal else.use=message||A keyboard and a green screen: ENTER SEQUENCE. You need all five cards.\nsound||event:/exploring/obstacles/keypad/keypad_selene_error
prop vaultdoorL obj.name=vaultdoor
prop vaultdoorL beh.move=0,0,1.3
prop vaultdoorL beh.moveTime=1.5
prop vaultdoorL beh.moveMode=switch
prop vaultdoorR obj.name=vaultdoor
prop vaultdoorR beh.move=0,0,-1.3
prop vaultdoorR beh.moveTime=1.5
prop vaultdoorR beh.moveMode=switch
prop releaselever obj.name=releaselever
prop releaselever beh.use=Pull the emergency release
prop releaselever on.use=message||The emergency release thunks over and the vault door slides open again - for a little while.\nopen|vaultdoor\nwait|30\nclose|vaultdoor
prop hatchhum sound.event=event:/exploring/relaystation/computer01
prop hatchhum sound.volume=0.5
prop hatchhum zone.radius=8

prop crashcamp zone.id=crashcamp
prop crashcamp zone.radius=10
prop crashcamp zone.message=The survivors' camp: tarps, a dead fire, a water still - and behind it in the reeds, the broken body of the plane.
prop gull zone.id=stationgull
prop gull zone.radius=8
prop gull zone.message=Station Gull: aerials, a dish, a hut full of radios. On the door, a symbol you've never seen - a gull in a circle.
prop kelpzone zone.id=stationkelp
prop kelpzone zone.radius=8
prop kelpzone zone.message=Station Kelp on the floor of the bay, its windows broken, fish swimming through its lab.
prop kelpair zone.id=kelpair
prop kelpair zone.radius=3
prop kelpair zone.repeat=1
prop kelpair zone.air=1
prop kelpbubbles atmo.particles=bubbles
prop kelpbubbles zone.radius=3
prop pike zone.id=pike
prop pike zone.radius=12
prop pike zone.message=Station Pike: cages, troughs - one cage torn open. Then a roar, and a polar bear comes out of the trees. Here. In a forest.
prop village zone.id=village
prop village zone.radius=12
prop village zone.message=A village of neat red houses round a green. Washing on a line, a game left on a table - and nobody, anywhere.
prop lantern zone.id=stationlantern
prop lantern zone.radius=5
prop lantern zone.message=Station Lantern: a telescope on a roof, pointed not at the sky but at the sea.
prop hatchzone zone.id=hatch
prop hatchzone zone.radius=3
prop hatchzone zone.message=The bottom of the hatch: a humming room, a terminal, a clock on the wall stopped at zero.
prop vaultroom zone.id=vaultroom
prop vaultroom zone.radius=3
prop vaultroom zone.message=Inside the Initiative's vault - and the counter outside is still running.
prop pikebear creature.count=1
prop pikebear creature.size=1.6
prop pikebear creature.health=3
prop pikebear creature.respawn=0
prop pikebear creature.zone=pike
prop boars creature.count=3
prop boars creature.respawn=0
prop hens creature.count=4
prop goats creature.count=3
prop turtles creature.count=2
prop dolphins creature.count=3
prop marshmist atmo.fog=#6a7a70
prop marshmist atmo.fogAmount=0.3
prop marshmist atmo.particles=mist
prop marshmist zone.radius=60

quest title=The Sequence
quest intro=A misty island with a plane in its marsh - and buildings that were here long before the plane. The survivors left a journal at their camp on the beach.
# Chapter 1 - the crash
step reach|crashcamp|1|Reach the survivors' camp by the wreck of Flight 9
step read|Survivors' journal|1|Read the survivors' journal
step open|Passenger's trunk|1|Search the reeds by the plane for a passenger's trunk
step reach|stationgull|1|Find the station with the aerials on the east rise
# Chapter 2 - the stations
step read|Orientation notes|1|Read the orientation notes in Station Gull
step collect|story:seqcard|1|Take Station Gull's Sequence card from the comms desk
step reach|stationkelp|1|Dive to Station Kelp, sunk in the bay
step collect|story:seqcard|2|Find Kelp's card in its flooded lab
step read|Station Pike|1|Read the sign at Station Pike's fence before you go in
step kill|Polar bear|1|Face the bear that broke out of Station Pike
step collect|story:seqcard|3|Take Pike's card from the keeper's locker
step reach|village|1|Walk into the residents' village in the west
step open|Village fridge|1|Raid the fridge humming in a village house - somebody still stocks it
step collect|story:seqcard|4|Find Station Moth's card in the village's council hall
step kill|Warthog|2|Drive off the boars rooting in the woods under the north hill
step reach|stationlantern|1|Climb to Station Lantern, the observatory on the north hill
step collect|story:seqcard|5|Take the last card from the observatory
# Chapter 3 - the hatch
step reach|hatch|1|Find the hatch in the marsh and climb down into it
step read|Hatch manual|1|Read the hatch's manual by the terminal
step collect|story:accesscard|1|Enter the Sequence at the terminal
step reach|vaultroom|1|Get through the vault door before the counter reaches zero
step open|Initiative's vault|1|Open the Initiative's vault
step blueprint|Blueprint_BatteryCharger|1|Take the battery charger plans from the initiative's vault
step blueprint|Blueprint_ZiplineTool|1|Take the zipline tool plans from the initiative's vault
quest done=The vault is open and the counter has stopped at zero. Nothing happened - or nothing you could see. The Initiative's stations stand empty in the mist, and the island keeps the rest of its secrets.
quest reward=CircuitBoard*2;MetalIngot*8;Cooked_GenericMeat*4

# Buried treasure (one of the story line's last islands): titanium ore on top of Raft's own treasure loot - the metal detector finds it, the shovel digs it
call treasure x=0 z=0 r=50 n=1 seed=8810
prop treasure8810 treasure.loot=TitaniumOre*3

save The Island of Stations
